Output demo.gif
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set FontSize 22
Set Framerate 60
# Hide the setup
Hide
Type "cargo run"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
# Record the demo
Sleep 2s
Type "]"  # Next dashboard
Sleep 2s
Right     # Next widget
Sleep 2s
Enter     # Maximize widget
Sleep 1s
Down      # Filter series
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Escape    # Exit maximized
Sleep 2s
Type "q"  # Quit
